Title: "Positive Decimal"
Id: "52a1c6a5-e8fe-46a8-a84d-cbcce6ee969b"

Text: "A `positive:` group with a `decimal:` section records the `positive decimal` classification.

```mlg-fragment
[positive.decimal]
positive:
decimal:
is: \"positive decimal\"
```

These groups are open-text metadata. The heading is optional and, when present, is a label header."
Id: "c21edf00-0077-4544-8de5-c30f3e513b74"
